			<div class="content" id="post-content-3710395">
									

<p>For one, SCP-682 is definitely not the most powerful scip (at least, in my headcanon its not).</p>
<p>The same question could be asked towards anyone and a fear of bugs. Why do we fear wasps when we are very obviously more powerful then them? It's because they can cause immense pain, as SCP-173 can to SCP-682.</p>
